        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Neihla zaeng gai o kaipou khou,",
            "Lungning ntun mei nun thiu le,",
            "Aniu kapah loumei Pu rui",
            "Rianra tuang guay ti-maan lou the.",
            "",
            "Neihla lou o,",
            "Neihla lou o, Poubaumei khou! 2",
            "",
            "2. Neihla o, kamei kaipou e,",
            "Kauh lev dihkhou dai liangmei e.",
            "Kalat rui ramguay ta sin e:",
            "Thuakpat lou khang ngam mei pu e.",
            "",
            "3. Nzihmei khang rihsu pukhou",
            "Zauzihmei rui tan guang sini!",
            "Houmak mei Ravguangc rimei rui;",
            "Zauzihmei khang suang ni tan e.",
            "",
            "4. Zinghmei rui nang ta haeng sini,",
            "Zingbang kum zingliam guang sini,",
            "Nang niu lungning tangkhin zat riu,",
            "Lum o rianramei luai mak saan.",
            "",
            "5. Neihla zaeng gai o, kaipou khou,",
            "Kata thuanhmei guay lusuan o;",
            "Nrah le tiangka khuan ruina,",
            "Kata thuanhmei guay lusuan o!"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
